{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、堀ちゃんのことをホタテちゃんと呼んでる能條愛未です。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～かぁいい～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人見知りのあみからしょっちゅう絡みにいってる感じ。なかなか珍しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀ちゃんは良い子だからそれにこころよく応じてくれてる感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度遊ぼうね～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、大丈夫、絶対3時間も待たせません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さって、昨日は幕張個別握手会でしたん❤はーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭にはこーんなのつけてみたもんねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子から突き出た角が可愛いトナカイさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはね、サンタコスプレしてるメンバーが多すぎて、やばい愛未クリスマス要素ゼロや..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って、「だれかぁ～～」って叫んでたらさゆりんごが、これ貸したろかーっていって貸してくれたもの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがなかなか好評だった(#^.^#)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未っぽいってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに全身だと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュールなポーズっていって一生懸命考えた結果こんなんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくたっく＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ワンピースはEMODAです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたたくさんの皆様ありがとう( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館前にパワーをもらえた気がしますっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きよ～\\(//∇//)\\笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館まであと残りわずかになってきましたー！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぅう～緊張するぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあみは、華麗に舞う！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/0003%20%282%29.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間リハの休憩の合間にどれだけ華麗にセクシーに踊れるかという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまたくだらない事をしてた私達をスタッフさんにムービーとってもらいました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムービーじたいはのっけられないから雰囲気ね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/12/16/5601645/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この調子で今日も一日頑張ります！笑"}],"source":"archive"}